sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User on Windows Desktop
    participant Explorer as Windows Explorer (SysListView32)
    participant FSW as FileSystemWatcher (User & Public Desktop)
    participant Hook as DesktopNativeHook (350ms Poll & Debounce)
    participant Service as DeskManagerService
    participant Interop as DesktopInterop (COM IFolderView)

    alt User Drags & Drops an Icon into a Gray Area ("Ongoing")
        User->>Explorer: Click & hold Left Mouse Button (VK_LBUTTON down), drag icon
        loop While VK_LBUTTON is held down
            Hook->>Hook: Check GetAsyncKeyState(VK_LBUTTON) != 0 -> Skip (Never interrupt drag!)
        end
        User->>Explorer: Release mouse button inside "Ongoing" Gray Area
        Hook->>Interop: GetDesktopIcons()
        Interop-->>Hook: Returns updated (X, Y) coordinates (>12px delta detected)
        Hook->>Hook: Start 450ms settle debounce timer
        Hook->>Service: ApplyAndSaveChange()
        Service->>Interop: SetDesktopIconPositions() -> Snaps icon cleanly to "Ongoing" grid cell
        Interop->>Explorer: SelectAndPositionItems(SVSI_POSITIONITEM)
    else New File Downloaded or Created on Desktop
        User->>Explorer: Save / Download file to Desktop folder
        Explorer->>FSW: Raises Created / Renamed event
        FSW->>Hook: OnDesktopFileChanged() -> Sets _pendingDesktopRearrange = true
        Hook->>Hook: Wait 450ms for Explorer to create desktop icon item
        Hook->>Service: ApplyAndSaveChange()
        Service->>Interop: Places new file cleanly into System Area (Files column) or matching Custom Area
        Interop->>Explorer: SelectAndPositionItems(SVSI_POSITIONITEM)
    end

